  "prompt": "Is the family home deductible from the gross estate, and up to how much?",
  "runtimeCommit": "d71b913ddf39726234dd02d858fac3e5275e865b",
  "answer": "### Short Answer\nYes, the family home is deductible from the gross estate, up to a maximum of P10,000,000.\n\n### Interpretation\n\n### Practical Meaning\nThis deduction is significant as it reduces the taxable estate, thereby potentially lowering the estate tax liability. Taxpayers should ensure that the family home is properly valued and documented to claim this deduction effectively.",
